  "description": "Neusro Bleach is an exuberant bubble font that exudes a charismatic, rounded boldness.\nCrafted to inject energy and character into your texts, this font is an embodiment of joy and mischief. Its bulky, funky letterforms are a promise of an interesting, fun, and attention-grabbing element to your designs.\nNeusro Bleach is tailored for children-centric designs, dynamic social media visuals, bold packaging designs, quirky brand identities, vibrant posters, and for the times when your creativity requires an audacious and effervescent flair. Be it an animated project or a playful digital brand, Neusro Bleach is all set to escalate the party in your designs.\nThis expressive font is packed with 210 uniquely-crafted glyphs, embracing uppercase, lowercase, and numeral punctuation, symbols & currencies. Not to mention, it also supports multiple languages and ligatures.\nThe charm of Neusro Bleach is not confined to children’s literature and illustrations, logo and branding design, or social media and YouTube thumbnails. It’s an excellent choice to incorporate a playful touch to your packaging, posters, event titles, DIY projects, scrapbooks, stickers, and beyond! Experience the Neusro Bleach, the font that brings a dash of fun and bubble-inspired style to your creative concepts.",
  "fullDescription": "<p><strong>Neusro Bleach is&nbsp;an exuberant bubble font that exudes a charismatic, rounded boldness.</strong></p>\n<p>Crafted to inject energy and character into your texts, this font is an embodiment of joy and mischief. Its bulky, funky letterforms are a promise of an interesting, fun, and attention-grabbing element to your designs.</p>\n<p>Neusro Bleach is tailored for children-centric designs, dynamic social media visuals, bold packaging designs, quirky brand identities, vibrant posters, and for the times when your creativity requires an audacious and effervescent flair. Be it an animated project or a playful digital brand, Neusro Bleach is all set to escalate the party in your designs.</p>\n<p>This expressive font is&nbsp;packed with 210 uniquely-crafted glyphs, embracing uppercase, lowercase, and numeral punctuation, symbols &amp; currencies. Not to mention, it also supports multiple languages and ligatures.</p>\n<p>The charm of Neusro Bleach is not confined to children’s literature and illustrations, logo and branding design, or social media and YouTube thumbnails. It’s an excellent choice to incorporate a playful touch to your packaging, posters, event titles, DIY projects, scrapbooks, stickers, and beyond! Experience the Neusro Bleach, the font that brings a dash of fun and bubble-inspired style to your creative concepts.</p>",
